     A*------------------------------------------------------------------------
     A          R SFL                       SFL
     A*%%TS  SD  20220714  125848  TTOGNAZZIN  REL-V7R4M0  5770-WDS
     A            SEL@           1A  P
     A            KEY           30A  H
     A            SEL       R        B 10  2REFFLD(OPTION)
     A                                      DSPATR(&SEL@)
     A            PGMNME    R        O 10  5
     A            PGMDES    R        O 10 16REFFLD(PGMDES)
     A*------------------------------------------------------------------------
     A          R SFLCTL                    SFLCTL(SFL)
     A*%%TS  SD  20220714  125455  TTOGNAZZIN  REL-V7R4M0  5770-WDS
     A                                      PAGEUP
     A                                      PAGEDOWN
     A                                      CF01
     A                                      CF02
     A                                      CF03
